line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >Variety (&#272;a d&#7841;ng v&#7873; ch&#7911;ng lo&#7841;i &#273;&#7883;nh d&#7841;ng): H&#7879; th&#7889;ng bao g&#7891;m s&#7921; k&#7871;t h&#7907;p gi&#7919;a thi&#7871;t b&#7883; c&#7911;a nhi&#7873;u h&#227;ng (Ericsson, Huawei, Nokia, ZTE) v&#224; nhi&#7873;u th&#7871; h&#7879; m&#7841;ng (3G, 4G LTE, 5G NR). &#272;&#7883;nh d&#7841;ng bao g&#7891;m: b&#7843;ng CSDL quan h&#7879; (RDBMS), file nh&#7853;t k&#253; Syslog, file c&#7845;u h&#236;nh tr&#7841;m XML/ASN.1, v&#224; lu&#7891;ng s&#7921; ki&#7879;n JSON/Protobuf.</span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
