line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >Veracity (T&#237;nh ch&#237;nh x&#225;c v&#224; &#273;&#7897; nhi&#7877;u): S&#243;ng v&#244; tuy&#7871;n di &#273;&#7897;ng li&#234;n t&#7909;c ch&#7883;u &#7843;nh h&#432;&#7903;ng b&#7903;i can nhi&#7877;u th&#7901;i ti&#7871;t m&#432;a b&#227;o, suy hao nh&#224; cao t&#7847;ng. D&#7919; li&#7879;u &#273;o ki&#7875;m th&#432;&#7901;ng xuy&#234;n xu&#7845;t hi&#7879;n c&#225;c gi&#225; tr&#7883; ngo&#7841;i lai (outlier), gi&#225; tr&#7883; &#226;m v&#244; l&#253; do l&#7879;ch xung &#273;&#7891;ng h&#7891; NTP (nh&#432; latency &#226;m), ho&#7863;c m&#7845;t g&#243;i &#273;o ki&#7875;m.</span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
