line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >Pha 1 (Put Transaction): Source nh&#7853;n d&#7919; li&#7879;u t&#7915; ngu&#7891;n ngo&#224;i, m&#7903; giao d&#7883;ch ghi v&#224;o Channel. Ch&#7881; khi to&#224;n b&#7897; batch s&#7921; ki&#7879;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c l&#432;u tr&#7919; an to&#224;n trong Channel, giao d&#7883;ch m&#7899;i &#273;&#432;&#7907;c Commit. N&#7871;u x&#7843;y ra l&#7895;i, giao d&#7883;ch b&#7883; Rollback v&#224; Source s&#7869; th&#7917; n&#7841;p l&#7841;i.</span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-left:18.0000pt;text-indent:-18.0000pt;tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;
