line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >Pha 2 (Take Transaction): Sink l&#7845;y batch s&#7921; ki&#7879;n t&#7915; Channel, m&#7903; giao d&#7883;ch v&#224; g&#7917;i t&#7899;i HDFS ho&#7863;c HBase. Ch&#7881; khi HDFS NameNode/DataNode x&#225;c nh&#7853;n &#273;&#227; ghi xong Block (Acknowledge), Sink m&#7899;i th&#7921;c hi&#7879;n Commit &#273;&#7875; x&#243;a s&#7921; ki&#7879;n kh&#7887;i Channel. N&#7871;u &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng truy&#7873;n m&#7841;ng &#273;&#7913;t, giao d&#7883;ch Rollback v&#224; s&#7921; ki&#7879;n v&#7851;n n&#7857;m nguy&#234;n trong Channel &#273;&#7875; g&#7917;i l&#7841;i.</span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
