line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >T&#7893;ng s&#7889; s&#7921; ki&#7879;n sinh ra trong 1 ng&#224;y: $$\text{Total Events/Day} = 2,000 \text{ cells} \times \left(\frac{86,400 \text{ s}}{5 \text{ s}}\right) = 34,560,000 \text{ s&#7921; ki&#7879;n/ng&#224;y}$$ </span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
