line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >M&#244; h&#236;nh &#273;&#432;&#7907;c hu&#7845;n luy&#7879;n b&#7857;ng h&#224;m glm(has_complaint ~ avg_latency + call_drop_rate + max_loss, family = binomial) tr&#234;n R. K&#7871;t qu&#7843; th&#7889;ng k&#234; cho th&#7845;y h&#7879; s&#7889; c&#7911;a call_drop_rate c&#243; gi&#225; tr&#7883; p-value &lt; 0.001 (r&#7845;t c&#243; &#253; ngh&#297;a th&#7889;ng k&#234;). Khi m&#7897;t thu&#234; bao g&#7863;p t&#7915; 2 cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i b&#7883; r&#7899;t tr&#7903; l&#234;n trong 24 gi&#7901;, x&#225;c su&#7845;t ph&#225;t sinh khi&#7871;u n&#7841;i ho&#7863;c h&#7911;y g&#243;i c&#432;&#7899;c l&#234;n t&#7899;i 82.4%.</span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
