line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" ><br></span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >C&#259;n c&#7913; d&#7919; li&#7879;u: C&#7843; 3 c&#244;ng c&#7909; (Pig, MapReduce, Spark) &#273;&#7873;u ghi nh&#7853;n &#273;&#7897; tr&#7877; trung b&#236;nh t&#7841;i 3 tr&#7841;m n&#224;y v&#432;&#7907;t 180 ms (ng&#432;&#7905;ng an to&#224;n &lt; 50ms), t&#7927; l&#7879; r&#7899;t cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i l&#234;n t&#7899;i 7.5% - 11.8% (v&#432;&#7907;t xa chu&#7849;n SLA 2.0%), chi&#7871;m t&#7899;i 62% khi&#7871;u n&#7841;i kh&#225;ch h&#224;ng. </span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" ><br></span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >H&#224;nh &#273;&#7897;ng: &#272;i&#7873;u &#273;&#7897;ng ngay tr&#7841;m ph&#225;t s&#243;ng l&#432;u &#273;&#7897;ng (Xe COW) chia t&#7843;i t&#7841;i khu v&#7921;c &#272;&#7889;ng &#272;a v&#224; Qu&#7853;n 3 trong tu&#7847;n n&#224;y; n&#226;ng c&#7845;p b&#259;ng th&#244;ng c&#225;p quang Backhaul tr&#7841;m t&#7915; 100 Mbps l&#234;n 1 Gbps. </span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-left:18.0000pt;text-indent:-18.0000pt;tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;
