line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >Khuy&#7871;n ngh&#7883; 2 - Th&#250;c &#273;&#7849;y l&#7897; tr&#236;nh t&#7855;t s&#243;ng 3G &#273;&#7875; gi&#7843;i ph&#243;ng b&#259;ng t&#7847;n cho 4G/5G: </span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" ><br></span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" >C&#259;n c&#7913; d&#7919; li&#7879;u: T&#7927; l&#7879; r&#7899;t cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i c&#7911;a 3G cao g&#7845;p 3.5 l&#7847;n so v&#7899;i 4G v&#224; g&#7845;p 8 l&#7847;n so v&#7899;i 5G; trong khi th&#244;ng l&#432;&#7907;ng 3G ch&#7881; &#273;&#7841;t trung b&#236;nh 6 - 8 Mbps. </span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
line-height:150%;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;" ><br></span><span class="18"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
